     "https://magic.wizards.com/en/news/magic-story/episode-3-shadows-of-regret#:~:text=they%20were%20sisters%2C%20in%20their%20way"
    ]
   },
   {
    "text": "At the gala she mistook Kellan for the detective Proft.",
