    ]
   },
   {
    "text": "Teysa and Kaya then found her dead, posed on a pile of coats in the cloakroom with a black iris petal in her fingers.",
    "cites": [
     "episode-2-monsters-we-became-e4",
     "episode-2-monsters-we-became-e5"
